"-The Device Firmware Update (DFU) app that is compatible with Nordic Semiconductor nRF51822 devices that have the S110 SoftDevice and bootloader enabled.\n\n-It allows to upload new application onto the device over-the-air (OTA).\n\n-The DFU discovers supported DFU devices, connects to them, and uploads user selected firmware applications to the device.\n\n-Default number of Packet Receipt Notification is 10 but you can set up other number in the iPhone Settings.\n\n-(New) Bin format is also supported in this version.\n\n-(New) This version supports Nordic Semiconductor softdevice 7.1 and SDK 7.1 and it is backword compatible. \n\n-(New) In SDK 7.0 and above initPacket is sent in a file (.dat) in addition to firmware file.\n\n-(New) For Application update application.hex or application.bin and application.dat is required inside a zip file.\n\n-(New) For Bootloader update bootloader.hex or bootloader.bin and bootloader.dat is required inside a zip file.\n\n-(New) For Softdevice update softdevice.hex or softdevice.bin and softdevice.dat is required.\n\n-(New) For updating both softdevice and bootloader system.dat is required in addition." = "-適用於啟用 S110 SoftDevice 和 bootloader 的 Nordic Semiconductor nRF51822 裝置的 Device Firmware Update (DFU) App。\n\n-可透過無線方式 (OTA) 將新應用程式上傳至裝置。\n\n-DFU 會搜尋支援的 DFU 裝置、連線並將使用者選擇的韌體應用程式上傳至裝置。\n\n-預設 Packet Receipt Notification 數量為 10，也可在 iPhone 設定中調整。\n\n-(新增) 此版本也支援 Bin 格式。\n\n-(新增) 此版本支援 Nordic Semiconductor softdevice 7.1 和 SDK 7.1，並向下相容。\n\n-(新增) SDK 7.0 及以上版本會將 initPacket 以檔案 (.dat) 形式隨韌體檔案一併傳送。\n\n-(新增) 更新應用程式時，zip 檔內必須包含 application.hex 或 application.bin，以及 application.dat。\n\n-(新增) 更新 Bootloader 時，zip 檔內必須包含 bootloader.hex 或 bootloader.bin，以及 bootloader.dat。\n\n-(新增) 更新 Softdevice 時，必須包含 softdevice.hex 或 softdevice.bin，以及 softdevice.dat。\n\n-(新增) 同時更新 softdevice 和 bootloader 時，還必須包含 system.dat。";
"-User can add Folders and Files with Hex, Bin and Zip extensions from Emails and iTunes.\n\n-User added files will be appeared here.\n\n- In order to add files from iTunes:\n   1. Open iTunes on your PC and connect iPhone to it.\n   2.On the left, under Devices select your iPhone.\n   3.on the top, select tab Apps.\n   4. on the bottom, under File Sharing select app nRF Toolbox and then add files." = "-使用者可從電子郵件和 iTunes 加入 Hex、Bin 和 Zip 格式的資料夾與檔案。\n\n-使用者加入的檔案會顯示於此處。\n\n-若要從 iTunes 加入檔案：\n   1. 在電腦上開啟 iTunes，並將 iPhone 連接至電腦。\n   2.在左側「裝置」下方選取 iPhone。\n   3.在上方選取「App」頁籤。\n   4.在底部「檔案共享」下方選取 App nRF Toolbox，然後加入檔案。";
"-User can add Folders and Files with Hex, Bin and Zip extensions from Emails and iTunes.\n\n-User added files will be appeared on tab User Files.\n\n- In order to add files from iTunes:\n   1. Open iTunes on your PC and connect iPhone to it.\n   2.On the left, under Devices select your iPhone.\n   3.on the top, select tab Apps.\n   4. on the bottom, under File Sharing select app nRF Toolbox and then add files.\n\n- In order to add files from Emails:\n   1. Attach file to your email.\n   2.Open your email on your iPhone.\n   3.Long click on attached file and then select Open in nRF Toolbox." = "-使用者可從電子郵件和 iTunes 加入 Hex、Bin 和 Zip 格式的資料夾與檔案。\n\n-使用者加入的檔案會顯示於「使用者檔案」頁籤。\n\n-若要從 iTunes 加入檔案：\n   1. 在電腦上開啟 iTunes，並將 iPhone 連接至電腦。\n   2.在左側「裝置」下方選取 iPhone。\n   3.在上方選取「App」頁籤。\n   4.在底部「檔案共享」下方選取 App nRF Toolbox，然後加入檔案。\n\n-若要從電子郵件加入檔案：\n   1. 將檔案附加至電子郵件。\n   2.在 iPhone 上開啟電子郵件。\n   3.長按附件，然後選取「在 nRF Toolbox 中開啟」。";
